        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+1 resilient explorer's clothing</em> is woven with thread spun by an elemental, and it sparkles with radiant color. A strong breeze wafts from the thread, blowing attacks off course. You gain resistance 5 to electricity damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Elemental Sheath</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The elemental threads cover your skin, further protecting you but limiting mobility. For 10 minutes, you gain resistance 5 to slashing and piercing damage but take a –5-foot status penalty to all Speeds. While activated, you gain a +1 status bonus to your AC against physical ranged attacks.</p>"
